{{LimitedContent}}
'''883-1''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Catnip Challenges]] during the [[Anniversary/14th Year|14th Anniversary]]. It was added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 883
|rarity = EX
|name1 = 883-1
|name2 = 883-2
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''883-2''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
High standing range and good anti-[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] crowd-control, 883-2 is fairly decent in the early-midgame. She can be stacked to permanently [[Weaken]] [[Teacher Bun Bun]] variants, and pierces all the way up to 733 range via guaranteed level 3 [[Wave Attack#Mini-Waves|Mini-Waves]], allowing 883-2 to easily snipe incoming threats from a distance. That said, she loses much of her viability the moment Bun Buns stop being threats, and somewhere along the line she's rendered obsolete by [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]], which doesn't bode well.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Sniper}}

